                5. TONE: Clinical, precise, superintelligent.
                6. CONCLUSIVITY: Use 'LOGIC LOCK' status and SNR metrics in your final validation.`,
            },
        });
    }

    try {
        const result = await activeChatSession.sendMessageStream({ message });
        let fullText = "";
